    "rotation": "eye_rotation_L/R (and _quat, _matrix): rotation of the eye's line of sight from straight ahead (forward_world), world frame, XYZ Euler, radians, torsion-free (Listing's law). eye_rotation_matrix @ forward_world = gaze_direction_world, which passes through fixation_target_world",
